OL,3,GNEWSAHousing association worker was
OL,4,Astabbed in heart before crashing car,
OL,5,Ainquest told
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman was stabbed in the heart before
OL,8,Fcrashing her car, an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FEleanor Barnfield, 47, died in hospital
OL,11,Fon 19 October after being found by
OL,12,Fparamedics with injuries to her chest
OL,13,Ffollowing the crash on Coity Road, in
OL,14,FBridgend.
OL,16,FAn inquest opening at Pontypridd
OL,17,FCoroner's Court on Thursday heard a
OL,18,Fprovisional cause of death for the
OL,19,Fhousing association worker had been
OL,20,Fgiven as "stab wound to the trunk
OL,21,Finvolving the heart".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
